WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.007 --> 00:00:02.657
CLINT BARTON
Kate, It's time.

00:00:02.708 --> 00:00:03.908
I just wanna know you're ready.

00:00:03.959 --> 00:00:04.709
KATE BISHOP
I'm ready.

00:00:07.166 --> 00:00:08.699
(The Marvel Universe...)

00:00:09.176 --> 00:00:10.550
(...is about to get...)

00:00:11.125 --> 00:00:12.776
(...a lot bigger.)

00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:15.625
CLINT BARTON
There's someone at the top.

00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:19.345
He's the guy I've been worried
about this whole time.

00:00:20.750 --> 00:00:21.375
KATE BISHOP
No way.

